//// set: ue-u1 — 用户枚举参数的结构求值：Evaluate、if 条件、修饰改值、包里的枚举、Integer()、别名、初始方程、维、属性、无绑定、常量
//// model: U10
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U10
parameter E e = E.b annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x;
equation
if e == E.a then
x = 1;
else
x = time;
end if;
end U10;
//// model: U11
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U11
parameter E e = E.b;
Real x;
equation
if e == E.a then
x = 1;
else
x = time;
end if;
end U11;
//// model: U12
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model A
parameter E e = E.a annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x;
equation
if e == E.a then
x = 1;
else
x = time;
end if;
end A;
model U12
A m(e = E.c);
end U12;
//// model: U13
package P
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
end P;
model U13
parameter P.E e = P.E.c annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x = if e > P.E.a then time else 0;
end U13;
//// model: U14
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U14
parameter E e = E.c annotation(Evaluate = true);
Integer k = Integer(e);
end U14;
//// model: U15
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U15
parameter E e = E.b annotation(Evaluate = true);
parameter E f = e;
end U15;
//// model: U16
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U16
parameter E e = E.b annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x;
initial equation
if e == E.b then
x = 1;
end if;
equation
der(x) = -x;
end U16;
//// model: U17
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U17
parameter E e = E.b annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x[if e == E.b then 2 else 1];
equation
x = fill(time, size(x, 1));
end U17;
//// model: U18
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U18
parameter E e = E.b annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x(start = if e == E.a then 1 else 2);
equation
der(x) = -x;
end U18;
//// model: U19
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U19
parameter E e = E.b annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x = if e == E.a or e == E.c then time else 2 * time;
end U19;
//// model: U110
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U110
parameter E e annotation(Evaluate = true);
Real x = time;
end U110;
//// model: U111
type E = enumeration(a, b, c);
model U111
constant E e = E.b;
Real x = if e == E.b then time else 0;
end U111;
